list_urls.description:
Add these addresses as list sources in Blocky's configuration. Each one contains a secret token: anyone who knows an address and connects from an allowed network can read that list.

{urls}

If Blocky runs as a Home Assistant app (add-on), it reaches Home Assistant under the host name homeassistant on port 8123; replace the host part accordingly.

zone_config.description:
Merge this fragment into the blocking section of Blocky's configuration. Home Assistant does not apply it. The list addresses contain a secret token, so keep the configuration private.

{config}

If Blocky runs as a Home Assistant app (add-on), it reaches Home Assistant under the host name homeassistant on port 8123; replace the host part accordingly.
